   "stem": {
      "text": "The function \\( f \\) has derivatives of all orders, with \\( f(2) = -1 \\), \\( f'(2) = 3 \\), \\( f''(2) = 1 \\), \\( f'''(2) = -2 \\). Let \\( g(x) = x f(x) \\). Find the second-degree Taylor polynomial for \\( g \\) about \\( x = 2 \\)."
