   "worked_solution": [
      {
         "step": 1,
         "text": "By the product rule, \\( g'(x) = f(x) + x f'(x) \\), and differentiating again, \\( g''(x) = 2 f'(x) + x f''(x) \\).",
         "mathjson": 8
      },
      {
         "step": 2,
         "text": "At \\( x = 2 \\): \\( g(2) = -2 \\), \\( g'(2) = 5 \\), \\( g''(2) = 8 \\).",
         "mathjson": 8
      },
      {
         "step": 3,
         "text": "Divide by the factorials: the coefficients are \\( -2 \\), \\( 5 \\), and \\( \\frac{8}{2!} = 4 \\).",
         "mathjson": 4
      },
      {
         "step": 4,
